   "seq": 15,
   "blockType": "paragraph",
   "level": null,
   "prefix": "",
   "source": "If you're able to use Kubernetes APIs for service discovery in your application,\nyou can query the API server\nfor matching EndpointSlices. Kubernetes updates the EndpointSlices for a Service\nwhenever the set of Pods in a Service changes.",
   "suffix": "\n\n",
   "translatable": true,
   "chunkIndex": 1,
   "target": "如果你的应用能够使用 Kubernetes API 进行服务发现，则可以向 API 服务器查询匹配的 EndpointSlices。每当服务中的 Pod 集合发生变化时，Kubernetes 都会更新该服务的 EndpointSlices。",
